Bind Npc 25171 Zone 1
Quest 1358 "Red Onix"
    Journal "Kill Horizon"
    Kill 1 of 9690, 9687 at direction_1345

Requires player level >= 35 and player is karus and quest 1315 is completed

Rewards
    Give 25000 experience
    Give 1 of 900628000

direction_1345 = location "Horizon" about "Guardian of Red Onyx. Spirit King summoned Horizon so that Onyx Power doesn't get used wrongfully. In the past, used to be a famous wizard of Elmorad." found "Karus" karus at 1812 397 in zone 1

On offer
    Say "Thank you, <selfname> for letting all three of us get together finally. I believe you said you needed Purification Pole?\n\nIn order to obtain the purification Pole, you'll need Red, Blue and Black Onyx. We have these onyx.\n\nBut, these guardians of Onyx won't allow us to uses onyx that easily. You'll need to show them how strong you are in order for us to use the onyx."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "In order to make Purified Pole, need Red Onyx. Leia should be able to summon Horizon who will summon Red Onyx. Defeat Horizon."

On in_progress
    Say "Brave <selfname>. When you are ready, just tell us to unseal the onyx."
    Topic "Unseal" do
        If daily 10 available
            Summon 1 of 9690 at 1812 397
        Else
            Say "Able to summon Horizon once per day. Can obtain a red Onix when defeating Horizon."

On claimable
    Show quest "Here's Red Onyx. You are so brave <selfname>."
